  "parts": [
    {
      "module": "09",
      "part": "07",
      "revision": "m09p07-sap-m09-p07-p09-approved-review",
      "approved_assets": {
        "1": "fd7adcd12cb3cfffbab87e2e7044f1a3cca13d84b66826fef906b5337e6d237b",
        "2": "fd7adcd12cb3cfffbab87e2e7044f1a3cca13d84b66826fef906b5337e6d237b",
        "3": "fd7adcd12cb3cfffbab87e2e7044f1a3cca13d84b66826fef906b5337e6d237b",
        "4": "6daedc0f2812e3744dcc84b3160c40cf6ccc19c8382edc718fbae46e8bc72cc1",
        "5": "6daedc0f2812e3744dcc84b3160c40cf6ccc19c8382edc718fbae46e8bc72cc1",
        "6": "01c2a85037c3620457b24ef837d3d711ee60df9030823a0a695b7139b3e6af69",
        "7": "01c2a85037c3620457b24ef837d3d711ee60df9030823a0a695b7139b3e6af69"
      },
      "units": [
        {
          "id": "m09-s19-01",
          "slide": 1,
          "text": "A video upload stalls after two parts. S three has stored the parts, but the client never finished the upload. The normal object listing shows nothing for that transfer, even though its parts can still incur storage charges.",
          "text_sha256": "21ecd4ab3b6806d6ed58246a9670f35030a1307851f2c6dd8b82a51e7873d51c",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "3616a399d1d6af2122b7a0c42e30417390c712ad9d4e49cda48329754afb1f48",
          "asset_sha256": "fd7adcd12cb3cfffbab87e2e7044f1a3cca13d84b66826fef906b5337e6d237b"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s19-02",
          "slide": 2,
          "text": "List multipart uploads to find its upload ID. List parts for that ID to see what landed. Resume if it's still needed; otherwise abort it. If parts were still uploading, verify cleanup afterwards.",
          "text_sha256": "0e092500269dd2d33b268ffe76601b654e8d8508707c82ee99886b579d78ee18",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "8d017666680f86a50a4feecbc600bea7a4e61eab1944abf8809d04dda325078e",
          "asset_sha256": "fd7adcd12cb3cfffbab87e2e7044f1a3cca13d84b66826fef906b5337e6d237b"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s19-03",
          "slide": 3,
          "text": "For abandoned uploads, set an abort window that gives legitimate clients enough time to finish. Expiring completed objects is a different rule.",
          "text_sha256": "792b201e2c0a1e72f2277370ed8a06912cfa8ca44d12690bed325b6c8858359a",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "792b201e2c0a1e72f2277370ed8a06912cfa8ca44d12690bed325b6c8858359a",
          "asset_sha256": "fd7adcd12cb3cfffbab87e2e7044f1a3cca13d84b66826fef906b5337e6d237b"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s20-01",
          "slide": 4,
          "text": "You only need a header? Request its byte range rather than downloading the whole object. S three takes one contiguous range per get; each interval here is a separate request.",
          "text_sha256": "5c4628f4cc850f1272c1b2c2c029611006344906a4667122ca7181df5cc57dca",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "61856e70b79bfadef57fd265daa3cf17e8a3ead8e63e39086423c1fdb5ac390b",
          "asset_sha256": "6daedc0f2812e3744dcc84b3160c40cf6ccc19c8382edc718fbae46e8bc72cc1"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s20-02",
          "slide": 5,
          "text": "If the third request fails, fetch those bytes again and assemble the pieces in order. If the key can change mid-download, pin one version or apply matching conditions, so you don't join bytes from different versions.",
          "text_sha256": "50c7f233f6305056664b57689ea5ffe4484cb6701960b6ef1d59f20ef6d9f389",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "fc50e2fa913723c66159a2f2ca5689dcc6bc353587b18fc38502e23a0bf8e70f",
          "asset_sha256": "6daedc0f2812e3744dcc84b3160c40cf6ccc19c8382edc718fbae46e8bc72cc1"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s21-01",
          "slide": 6,
          "text": "Transfer Acceleration changes the journey a distant client takes to reach the bucket. The accelerate endpoint takes traffic into an ay double-you ess edge location and over the ay double-you ess network. The bucket stays in its original Region.",
          "text_sha256": "059707e4aa0d20a40c2b14ae997c63d04b7cd1df7c7613e94774ba2a2c2f9bd8",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "5c4f918e9f9ea255de08e5f392841a38dc9adc6357b3964925982b3e4e871aa7",
          "asset_sha256": "01c2a85037c3620457b24ef837d3d711ee60df9030823a0a695b7139b3e6af69"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s21-02",
          "slide": 7,
          "text": "Multipart changes how the upload is split and retried. You can combine the two. Compare the same representative upload with and without acceleration, and weigh the measured improvement against charges.",
          "text_sha256": "60e00b822700ab4148ab3476e117274fe75080eacec21136a3176c6954d12f03",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "60e00b822700ab4148ab3476e117274fe75080eacec21136a3176c6954d12f03",
          "asset_sha256": "01c2a85037c3620457b24ef837d3d711ee60df9030823a0a695b7139b3e6af69"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "09",
      "part": "08",
      "revision": "m09p08-sap-m09-p07-p09-approved-review",
      "approved_assets": {
        "1": "ea05934cfdba43016d8da24725d470d4fa442e68813f83c389163f94d7c2827c",
        "2": "ea05934cfdba43016d8da24725d470d4fa442e68813f83c389163f94d7c2827c",
        "3": "9ab00bf01c070080c7da8e5163821be1d714edba2373559406e6e826ca585c80",
        "4": "9ab00bf01c070080c7da8e5163821be1d714edba2373559406e6e826ca585c80",
        "5": "9ab00bf01c070080c7da8e5163821be1d714edba2373559406e6e826ca585c80",
        "6": "5201c1e86771eb4ebed654ea9cf8f400e30d326069938f39252cc898c2169eab",
        "7": "5201c1e86771eb4ebed654ea9cf8f400e30d326069938f39252cc898c2169eab"
      },
      "units": [
        {
          "id": "m09-s22-01",
          "slide": 1,
          "text": "S three Select is not available to new customers. The older design is useful to recognize: ask S three to filter rows or columns of one supported CSV, JSON or par-kay object and return just the matching result.",
          "text_sha256": "efe535c5fd45d1e44f0468c0a0dc65cc1685da3ae932c310206f9237066a77e6",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "6131a379e74842429586acc4379cb232916602031ba70d46c9914b461e29b832",
          "asset_sha256": "ea05934cfdba43016d8da24725d470d4fa442e68813f83c389163f94d7c2827c"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s22-02",
          "slide": 2,
          "text": "That cuts the bytes sent to the client. For a new workload querying data across many objects, evaluate Athena or another appropriate query engine. Don't confuse one-object filtering with querying a dataset.",
          "text_sha256": "9d7c5970f133863e674f43f3b30c22fff78b90bea70601541c529d40ecc135b8",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "a3d846bad1e5a27d28a3b9c48a87c5a7cf33237cd87bbee7595500234e53fceb",
          "asset_sha256": "ea05934cfdba43016d8da24725d470d4fa442e68813f83c389163f94d7c2827c"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s23-01",
          "slide": 3,
          "text": "If you're considering moving rarely read reports out of S three Standard, scope Storage Class Analysis to those reports with a prefix or tag.",
          "text_sha256": "1fe343cfe98dccd346279ad273c7e341ca82d8fe0b58e7ceb0ea199f8adbc347",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "5b20cdeb884b94ee2fe3a11a1b1ecb8f0ae929aab9e2bb5bfa77ad73e07e872e",
          "asset_sha256": "9ab00bf01c070080c7da8e5163821be1d714edba2373559406e6e826ca585c80"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s23-02",
          "slide": 4,
          "text": "Early data can appear in a day or two, but ay double-you ess says it usually takes about thirty days of observations to develop useful results. This feature recommends Standard to Standard-IA only.",
          "text_sha256": "7c0efb677b764b16739196e44b64221d38f49c9a4017eb157355c92838f5c5a8",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "87abdc357f0b94304eb619c4882389340730c7df22d2ff810ba55c09b2182092",
          "asset_sha256": "9ab00bf01c070080c7da8e5163821be1d714edba2373559406e6e826ca585c80"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s23-03",
          "slide": 5,
          "text": "If the result supports it after checking retrieval charges and minimum duration, you configure the lifecycle rule separately. Analysis does not move anything.",
          "text_sha256": "4e7bb4d030cf515127f9b3db5f80de19712b9449f222e6873f2dad4698a0d0f2",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "4e7bb4d030cf515127f9b3db5f80de19712b9449f222e6873f2dad4698a0d0f2",
          "asset_sha256": "9ab00bf01c070080c7da8e5163821be1d714edba2373559406e6e826ca585c80"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s24-01",
          "slide": 6,
          "text": "Storage Lens rolls up usage and activity from buckets, accounts and Regions; with Organizations it can show the broader estate. Start wide when you don't know where storage is growing, then narrow the scope to the affected buckets.",
          "text_sha256": "dcd59c6a745ba84653f9355fa8d64b934abcc603937c5217d6dd114c716cce25",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "17899b7b907c4926ad6b9de989ad857f4ef102f38f7c717dae0e3db27fd5a50d",
          "asset_sha256": "5201c1e86771eb4ebed654ea9cf8f400e30d326069938f39252cc898c2169eab"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s24-02",
          "slide": 7,
          "text": "There's a preconfigured default dashboard, a custom dashboard for a tailored view, and daily CSV or par-kay exports to an authorized S three destination. This is evidence, not a policy that changes the buckets.",
          "text_sha256": "f9b7e92a870c6f8493bf443ded820a26ce783a1a0343d2ca70eee48b80033be1",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "7ceb3035cfacf9b573eb97d3cb5148207895887e8eeac8652becfb75d72fe7fd",
          "asset_sha256": "5201c1e86771eb4ebed654ea9cf8f400e30d326069938f39252cc898c2169eab"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "09",
      "part": "09",
      "revision": "m09p09-sap-m09-p07-p09-approved-review",
      "approved_assets": {
        "1": "27ddb10fa58f17e568ab3f57c3f19fef9b800f7632504dca035d72f46bf1f4c2",
        "2": "27ddb10fa58f17e568ab3f57c3f19fef9b800f7632504dca035d72f46bf1f4c2",
        "3": "850a9d983a19efa7449ca946b06b790cd025838a4593a43b090d7bb2fb0673eb",
        "4": "850a9d983a19efa7449ca946b06b790cd025838a4593a43b090d7bb2fb0673eb",
        "5": "850a9d983a19efa7449ca946b06b790cd025838a4593a43b090d7bb2fb0673eb",
        "6": "f8b1bfca13444e01f9d765625dcb2216d50f6ba112d1f400803050b5dafe6a95",
        "7": "f8b1bfca13444e01f9d765625dcb2216d50f6ba112d1f400803050b5dafe6a95",
        "8": "f8b1bfca13444e01f9d765625dcb2216d50f6ba112d1f400803050b5dafe6a95",
        "9": "f9b38676f01ca1f61ff55a1181629a43956205d0b6b58b7d58b25cf110fccafd",
        "10": "f9b38676f01ca1f61ff55a1181629a43956205d0b6b58b7d58b25cf110fccafd",
        "11": "f9b38676f01ca1f61ff55a1181629a43956205d0b6b58b7d58b25cf110fccafd"
      },
      "units": [
        {
          "id": "m09-s25-01",
          "slide": 1,
          "text": "Bytes rose, but the visible object count barely moved. Check retained noncurrent versions and abandoned multipart uploads; a normal current-object listing can miss both.",
          "text_sha256": "48552eee3e2bbff70ea997bef79ad2ae693daf961c78be56ad93355835b1dcfb",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "48552eee3e2bbff70ea997bef79ad2ae693daf961c78be56ad93355835b1dcfb",
          "asset_sha256": "27ddb10fa58f17e568ab3f57c3f19fef9b800f7632504dca035d72f46bf1f4c2"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s25-02",
          "slide": 2,
          "text": "If old versions account for the increase, choose retention based on recovery needs. If orphaned upload parts are the cause, use a multipart cleanup rule. Don't apply the same fix to both.",
          "text_sha256": "6d2fc42ff6f817c9fd569ab3c57c0c36fe10cc9ff080cd1ef12b63cdd68f1634",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "f93cf766fc3e12f300d5c67a7b457b05b143093cdc7ca83fd1b2b7f346ddc0a5",
          "asset_sha256": "27ddb10fa58f17e568ab3f57c3f19fef9b800f7632504dca035d72f46bf1f4c2"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s26-01",
          "slide": 3,
          "text": "The dashboard shows signals from settings like versioning, encryption and replication. Check an actual object version or replica to confirm the safeguard covers the data you care about.",
          "text_sha256": "bd8db26502aed1c33b04172b5d5fbb5e665eeff3d376896b15086dfbe28403a8",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "bd8db26502aed1c33b04172b5d5fbb5e665eeff3d376896b15086dfbe28403a8",
          "asset_sha256": "850a9d983a19efa7449ca946b06b790cd025838a4593a43b090d7bb2fb0673eb"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s26-02",
          "slide": 4,
          "text": "Bucket owner enforced disables A C Ls; bucket and I A M policies still decide access.",
          "text_sha256": "29f5d422f887568827886851f98c5ba8d2b3f5e6710390aae4a1712e098911fa",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "c55f1233287b87189b0924c913f7a0c5964e6008489f6d1757175edfbdd3e93c",
          "asset_sha256": "850a9d983a19efa7449ca946b06b790cd025838a4593a43b090d7bb2fb0673eb"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s26-03",
          "slide": 5,
          "text": "A bucket with notifications enabled tells you the feature is configured, not that a downstream worker processed an event. Check that separately.",
          "text_sha256": "08a5c08cf5cbb098cd2f886b6595d28e92e766251618fc2e7891e28dfcec6ac4",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "08a5c08cf5cbb098cd2f886b6595d28e92e766251618fc2e7891e28dfcec6ac4",
          "asset_sha256": "850a9d983a19efa7449ca946b06b790cd025838a4593a43b090d7bb2fb0673eb"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s27-01",
          "slide": 6,
          "text": "The request and byte counts show work done, not whether the work succeeded.",
          "text_sha256": "13b9b13329ecc8b98d1514be00af34d04661c2ae5754cca90c4c08a39543766f",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "13b9b13329ecc8b98d1514be00af34d04661c2ae5754cca90c4c08a39543766f",
          "asset_sha256": "f8b1bfca13444e01f9d765625dcb2216d50f6ba112d1f400803050b5dafe6a95"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s27-02",
          "slide": 7,
          "text": "Acceleration enabled is a configuration signal. Benchmark real transfers to measure the effect.",
          "text_sha256": "263c6a96f603bf9df762106e85a7506a32ec0124fc8b76ac553aa971a6dd6693",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "263c6a96f603bf9df762106e85a7506a32ec0124fc8b76ac553aa971a6dd6693",
          "asset_sha256": "f8b1bfca13444e01f9d765625dcb2216d50f6ba112d1f400803050b5dafe6a95"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s27-03",
          "slide": 8,
          "text": "A rise in four-oh-three or four-oh-four responses tells you where to investigate. Check the requester's permissions and exact key. For an absent key, S three can return four-oh-three rather than four-oh-four if the caller lacks ListBucket, so the status alone is not the root cause.",
          "text_sha256": "d72037b50f723c6d934c4f78795e0b13d0c39407cd3234c9cdd153ae3b736139",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "e3e67c3d6c83c4b8019e20454b28f447d14dc2962f9696b2f9d49163edd20aae",
          "asset_sha256": "f8b1bfca13444e01f9d765625dcb2216d50f6ba112d1f400803050b5dafe6a95"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s28-01",
          "slide": 9,
          "text": "For a recent bucket-level usage check, use the free dashboard. Its console query window is fourteen days.",
          "text_sha256": "e1d622c543ae8ff5afc812d35cfaafa0f466226ec8ebaed716f501fb49285972",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "e1d622c543ae8ff5afc812d35cfaafa0f466226ec8ebaed716f501fb49285972",
          "asset_sha256": "f9b38676f01ca1f61ff55a1181629a43956205d0b6b58b7d58b25cf110fccafd"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s28-02",
          "slide": 10,
          "text": "For a longer console comparison or detailed activity and status metrics, consider Advanced. It supports fifteen months of queries, optional features such as publishing to CloudWatch, and richer prefix reporting. Prefix-level Storage Lens metrics themselves aren't published to CloudWatch.",
          "text_sha256": "357fafd4607628f27b5454ce454618f623aa2deb2b3c10ff559bedac391f2ca0",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "71dbb03d750abf10766d08613f0e6609e6460c63f617f820200418594bda22a2",
          "asset_sha256": "f9b38676f01ca1f61ff55a1181629a43956205d0b6b58b7d58b25cf110fccafd"
        },
        {
          "id": "m09-s28-03",
          "slide": 11,
          "text": "Retained for fifteen months doesn't mean you can query fifteen months in the free dashboard.",
          "text_sha256": "46d3b8f2d94060b48b69a897a808ab85282c45878b46620cb31e952a2bafcbbb",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "0b38f0c2220e14d868c371e7e7205f9e63cfaf2896d48efbdeb44e37447d59c3",
          "asset_sha256": "f9b38676f01ca1f61ff55a1181629a43956205d0b6b58b7d58b25cf110fccafd"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
